      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Live receipt telemetry\nThese panels query the gateway's emitted native receipt families. The separate backend contract fixture is synthetic and is not treated as live utilization, memory-pressure, synchronization, or graph evidence."
      }
